Error [E0202]: The write-access marker `&` needs a plain named binding after it
  --> tests/ui/sigil_write_capability_misuse.jet:6:11
    |
  6 |     edit(&(1 + 2))
    |           ^
 Why: Write access from the write-access marker `&` can only be granted to a named binding, not an expression
 Fix: Bind the value first: `x := ...` then pass `&x` with the write-access marker `&`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0202
